# Manifold level 10
# The tower's entrance (stages 5b and 5c): a floor to prove the games' shell and the platformer's
# controller, not one of the tower's own (5d builds those by the gym's measures). Up a stair onto
# platforms a meter up, across a gap of 2 m (a walking jump carries its middle 3.4 m), up a stair to
# the goal 2 m up. Beside the gap, a chimney of two walls 6 m high and 2.4 m apart with a star in it,
# 5 m up: leaping from wall to wall (the gym: up to 4 m apart).
title The entrance
spawn 0 1 6
facing 0 0 -1
sky 18.75

kit floor_4  -4 0 6
kit floor_4  0 0 6
kit floor_4  4 0 6
kit floor_4  -4 0 2
kit floor_4  0 0 2
kit floor_4  4 0 2
kit floor_4  -4 0 -2
kit floor_4  0 0 -2
kit floor_4  4 0 -2
kit floor_4  -4 0 -6
kit floor_4  0 0 -6
kit floor_4  4 0 -6
kit floor_4  -4 0 -10
kit floor_4  0 0 -10
kit floor_4  4 0 -10
kit floor_4  -4 0 -14
kit floor_4  0 0 -14
kit floor_4  4 0 -14
kit floor_4  -4 0 -18
kit floor_4  0 0 -18
kit floor_4  4 0 -18
kit floor_4  -4 0 -22
kit floor_4  0 0 -22
kit floor_4  4 0 -22

kit stairs_1    0 0 0
kit platform_2  0 0 -2
kit platform_2  0 0 -4
kit platform_2  0 0 -8
kit platform_2  0 0 -10
kit platform_2  0 0 -12
kit stairs_1    0 1 -14
kit platform_2  0 1 -16
kit platform_2  0 1 -18

# The chimney: walls of the kit, two stacked, turned to face each other across x = 5.35.
kit wall_4  4 0 -8  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  4 3 -8  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  6.7 0 -8  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  6.7 3 -8  rotate y 90

sensor checkpoint  0 1.8 -3     1 0.8 2
sensor goal        0 2.8 -17    1 0.8 1
sensor star        5.35 5 -8    0.6 0.8 0.6
sensor fall        0 -6 0       60 3 60
